## 4. Zone Priority & User Experience

### 4.1 Priority Zone Logic (Visitor's Zone First)

```javascript
// Zone Priority Algorithm
const getActiveZone = async (user) => {
  // Priority 1: User's GPS-detected current location
  if (user.currentGPS) {
    const nearestZone = await findNearestRegion(user.currentGPS.lat, user.currentGPS.lng);
    if (nearestZone) return nearestZone;
  }
  
  // Priority 2: User's manually selected zone (stored in localStorage/AsyncStorage)
  if (user.selectedZoneId) {
    return await getRegion(user.selectedZoneId);
  }
  
  // Priority 3: User's registered/home zone
  if (user.region_id) {
    return await getRegion(user.region_id);
  }
  
  // Priority 4: Default to nearest major city zone
  return await getDefaultRegion(user.state || 'Maharashtra');
};
```

